{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268mB4C68XIv1794928218.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>朝鮮領袖金正恩和女兒視察邊境滑雪設施，引發金正恩可能到中國的猜測。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.KIM-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jdYmqjN3Lp1794928241.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>朝鮮電視台和通訊社，發放金正恩女兒金主愛滑雪的片段和照片。報道指金正恩兩父女，近日視察鄰近中國邊境的觀光區建設工程、觀光鐵路和度假村。韓國情報機關認為，金主愛正被培養成為金正恩接班人。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.KIM-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UruhiAFEiv1794928257.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>美國總統特朗普早前表示，他稍後在中國出席亞太經合組織APEC會議期間，可能會同金正恩會晤。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T15:56:20.700185+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T14:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:38:20.038701+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:43.190578+00:00","content_hash":"a17260990b8671042a5a469795b2148e54d92a8389eabee5e05bdfeac020b284","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T15:56:20.700185+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}